t exist)\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 14 (page does not exist)\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Crossnumber_Puzzle\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Crossnumber Puzzle\">Crossnumber Puzzle</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Logic_Puzzle\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Logic Puzzle\">Logic Puzzle</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 1\">Practice Relay 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 2\">Practice Relay 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_3\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 3\">Practice Relay 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_4\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 4\">Practice Relay 4</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 1\">Relay A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 2\">Relay A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 3\">Relay A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Relay A 4</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 1\">Relay B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 2\">Relay B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_3\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 3\">Relay B 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_4\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 4\">Relay B 4</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_C_Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay C Problem 1\">Relay C 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_C_Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay C Problem 2\">Relay C 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_C_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay C Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Relay C 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_C_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay C Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Relay C 4</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Team_Up_Challenge\" title=\"CEMC Team Up Challenge\">CEMC Team Up Challenge</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018032500\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.074 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node c